  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "AgiBotWorld2026",
  "description": "\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAgiBot World 2026\n\t\n\nReal-World Embodied Intelligence Dataset\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\nAs robotics research advances into real-world scenarios, the demand for authentic, high-quality data has become increasingly urgent. Following AGIBOT WORLD's \"ImageNet moment,\" we now release the AGIBOT WORLD 2026 dataset. Built upon massive real-world scenes, it systematically spans pivotal research directions in embodied intelligence, designed to power the next generation of\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/agibot-world/AgiBotWorld2026.",
